dered the preview instantly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Moving Skills above Education and toggling Education visibility updated the preview instantly (headings reordered / removed / restored). After navigating to other tabs, back to the dashboard and reopening the resume, the preview still renders About Me → Career History → Abilities → Studies, preserving the new layout.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"No save button exists; edits made across Contact/Summary/Experience/Education/Skills/Template/Sections tabs survived navigating back to the dashboard and reopening the resume. Dashboard card showed \\\"Updated Aug 28, 2026\\\" (today) and template badge Classic reflecting the edits.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Classic style preview rendered every visible section with content: contact name/details, About Me, Career History (2 jobs), Abilities, Studies (2 schools). With an overlong summary the preview column grew (933px) beyond the 720px viewport and the page scrolled (scrollHeight 1043 → scrollTop 323) so the resume end was reachable and readable.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After switching among all 7 editor tabs, returning to the dashboard and reopening the resume: contact inputs all retained (Ada Lovelace/ada@example.com/555-0100/London, UK/linkedin.com/in/ada/ada.dev) and preview still shows summary, both jobs, both schools and skills Algorithms • Mathematics.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Copy edited (name→Ada Data Lovelace, email→data.ada@example.com, +Statistics skill): original unchanged. Then original edited (phone→555-7777): copy still shows phone 555-0100 and its own edited values. Isolation holds both directions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Renamed via editor title to \\\"Ada Engineer Resume\\\"; editor.title reads \\\"Ada Engineer Resume\\\" and the dashboard card dashboard.resumes.item.o0wvr1zexe shows the same title.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Customized summary heading not rendered in the Minimal style\", \"actual\": \"Section titles were customized to Reach Me / About Me / Career History / Studies / Abilities. Modern and Classic previews render \\\"About Me\\\", \\\"Career History\\\", \\\"Studies\\\", \\\"Abilities\\\". In the Minimal style the Summary section is visible (its text is rendered) but no preview.summary.heading element exists, so \\\"About Me\\\" is never shown. (The customizable Contact title \\\"Reach Me\\\" is also not rendered in any of the three styles.)\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
